{"title": "Shadow Curse (Condition)", "pageid": 14418, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has tick type", "Has stack priority", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse\" title=\"Shadow Curse\">Shadow Curse</a></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Curse Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Shadow Curse</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Without a light source, you will take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage every turn. This damage <b>doubles</b> each turn the party members are affected by the Shadow Curse. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SCL_SAFE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSCL_SAFE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSCL_SAFE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 1\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Umbral_Influx\">Condition: Umbral Influx</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Umbral_Influx_(Condition)\" title=\"Umbral Influx (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Umbral Influx\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Umbral_Influx_(Condition)\" title=\"Umbral Influx (Condition)\">Umbral Influx</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Tendrils of shadow engulf the corpse, until it becomes unclear where the body ends and the shadows begin.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When a member of the party is affected by the Shadow Curse, the game automatically enters Turn-Based Mode.</li>\n<li>Damage from the Shadow Curse caps out at <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">16d4 (16~64)</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> per turn.</li>\n<li>NPCs and enemies that are not already undead receive the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Umbral_Influx_(Condition)\" title=\"Umbral Influx (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Umbral Influx\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Umbral_Influx_(Condition)\" title=\"Umbral Influx (Condition)\">Umbral Influx</a> when killed, then revive with half their HP and the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Undead (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow-Cursed Undead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Undead (Condition)\">Shadow-Cursed Undead</a> condition if killed without protection from it.</li>\n<li>Effective means of avoiding the Shadow Curse include:\n<ul><li>Lit <a href=\"/wiki/Torch\" title=\"Torch\">Torches</a>, nearby braziers, and other environmental light sources</li>\n<li>Spells that emit light, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light\" title=\"Light\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Light_Icon.webp/25px-Light_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Light_Icon.webp/38px-Light_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Light_Icon.webp/50px-Light_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Light_Icon.webp/25px-Light_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Light_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light\" title=\"Light\">Light</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights\" title=\"Dancing Lights\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/25px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/38px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/50px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dancing Lights\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp/25px-Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Dancing_Lights_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights\" title=\"Dancing Lights\">Dancing Lights</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame\" title=\"Produce Flame\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Produce_Flame_Icon.webp/25px-Produce_Flame_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Produce_Flame_Icon.webp/38px-Produce_Flame_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Produce_Flame_Icon.webp/50px-Produce_Flame_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Produce Flame\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Produce_Flame_Icon.webp/25px-Produce_Flame_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Produce_Flame_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Produce_Flame\" title=\"Produce Flame\">Produce Flame</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daylight\" title=\"Daylight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/25px-Daylight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/38px-Daylight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/50px-Daylight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daylight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp/25px-Daylight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Daylight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daylight\" title=\"Daylight\">Daylight</a></li>\n<li>Pieces of magical equipment that naturally emit light, such as <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Blood_of_Lathander\" title=\"The Blood of Lathander\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/The_Blood_of_Lathander_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Blood_of_Lathander\" title=\"The Blood of Lathander\">The Blood of Lathander</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blessing_of_Sel%C3%BBne_(Condition)\" title=\"Blessing of Selûne (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Selune%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Selune%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Selune%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blessing of Selûne\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Selune%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Selune%27s_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blessing_of_Sel%C3%BBne_(Condition)\" title=\"Blessing of Selûne (Condition)\">Blessing of Selûne</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pixie Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\">Pixie Blessing</a></li>\n<li>A <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\">Moonlantern</a> or <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lantern\" title=\"Shadow Lantern\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Moonlantern_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lantern\" title=\"Shadow Lantern\">Shadow Lantern</a> carried in the active weapon set or placed on the ground nearby.</li>\n<li>Using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/25px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/38px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/50px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Remove Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp/25px-Remove_Curse_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Remove_Curse_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Remove_Curse\" title=\"Remove Curse\">Remove Curse</a> to remove the condition. However, leaving and re-entering an affected area re-applies the condition.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul></li>\n<li>Within deeper pockets of the Shadow Curse, such as the area surrounding the <a href=\"/wiki/Reithwin_Town\" title=\"Reithwin Town\">Reithwin Town</a> waypoint, weaker light sources may be immediately snuffed out. In these areas, <i>only</i> a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pixie Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\">Pixie Blessing</a>, Moonlantern or Shadow Lantern prevents the Shadow Curse from affecting the party.</li>\n<li>Enduring the Shadow Curse for two consecutive rounds without dying awards <a href=\"/wiki/Inspiration\" title=\"Inspiration\">Inspiration</a> to a character with the <a href=\"/wiki/Outlander\" title=\"Outlander\">Outlander</a> background.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>SCL_SAFE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Moonshield\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonshield_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonshield (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonshield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Moonshield_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonshield (Condition)\">Moonshield</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Protected by the light of a <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlantern\" title=\"Moonlantern\">Moonlantern</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Lantern\" title=\"Shadow Lantern\">Shadow Lantern</a>. The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Shadow Curse</a> does not affect this entity.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Pixie_Blessing\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pixie Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Moonshield_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Pixie Blessing (Condition)\">Pixie Blessing</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Shadow Curse</a> cannot affect this creature thanks to a pixie's protective magic.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Shadow_Curse\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Shadow Curse</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Without a light source, you will take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage every turn. This damage <b>doubles</b> each turn the party members are affected by the Shadow Curse.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:lt